[TITLE]
InpWriter round-trip fixture: authored form must survive Open -> Save
LINK_OFFSETS is ELEVATION, so every offset/crest below is an absolute
elevation that the parser rewrites as a depth above the node invert. C_ADV is
an adverse-slope conduit (J1 invert 10, J2 invert 12) that the parser reverses
under DYNWAVE. Before the fix the writer emitted the parser's depths under an
ELEVATION header and C_ADV with From/To swapped, so a second open clamped the
offsets to zero and the conduit pointed the wrong way in the file.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         ELEVATION
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/02/2020
END_TIME             00:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30
MIN_SLOPE            0

[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT   0.0
DRY_ONLY   NO

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1       10.0  5.0       0          0         0
J2       12.0  5.0       0          0         0
J3       11.0  5.0       0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type  StageData  Gated
O1       8.0   FREE  *          NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Length  Roughness  InOffset  OutOffset  InitFlow  MaxFlow
C_ADV    J1        J2      300.0   0.013      10.5      12.25      0.75      0
C_OK     J2        J3      300.0   0.013      12.5      11.0       0         0

[ORIFICES]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Type    Offset  Cd    Gated  CloseTime
OR1      J3        O1      SIDE    11.5    0.65  NO     0

[WEIRS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Type        CrestHt  Cd    Gated  EC  Cd2  Sur
W1       J3        O1      TRANSVERSE  12.0     3.33  NO     0   0    YES

[OUTLETS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Offset  Type              C1     C2     Gated
L1       J3        O1      11.25   FUNCTIONAL/HEAD   10.0   0.5    NO

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape     Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
C_ADV    CIRCULAR  1.0    0      0      0      1
C_OK     CIRCULAR  1.0    0      0      0      1
OR1      CIRCULAR  0.5    0      0      0
W1       RECT_OPEN 1.0    2.0    0      0

[LOSSES]
;;Link  Kentry  Kexit  Kavg  FlapGate  Seepage
C_ADV    0.1     0.2    0     NO        0

[COORDINATES]
;;Node  X  Y
J1  0    0
J2  300  0
J3  600  0
O1  900  0

[VERTICES]
;;Link  X    Y
C_ADV   100  10
C_ADV   200  -10
